<title>USA: Wave Technologies buys Corrigan Group.</title>
<headline>Wave Technologies buys Corrigan Group.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wave Technologies International Inc said Tuesday is acquired the assets of Corrigan Group Inc, a consulting firm that develops networking-related training programs and seminars.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not announced.</p>
<p>The company also appointed Patrick Corrigan vice president of its Novell Curriculum Development and Strategic Marketing division, which provides training for Novell Inc computer software products.</p>
<p>Wave Technologies develops training and instructional products. Its stock was down 1/8 Tuesday at 6.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
